UID:469c083853af26646cbee41d6793706edf59e6f8-ed77f93b8fd0bf6676efebeae4adbe6f13d7f9a3-TH-120000@school110.innosoftfusiongo.com
DTSTAMP:20260422T065622Z
SUMMARY:Group Fitness - Full Body Strength
LOCATION:Studio 1
DESCRIPTION:This workout uses resistance training with high repetitions to activate fast twitch muscle fibers. You will grow strong\, lean muscle mass and enhance your athleticism. The calorie burn won’t just stop after the class is over - your lean muscle fibers will keep you burning calories for long after you’ve left!
